    "instant_6x_bs_x_ih_h_qkcqi9b5_CxMYiP": {
      "type": "instant-6xBsXIhHQkcqi9b5",
      "name": "Frequency Asked Questions",
      "settings": {
        "text_XLlhigl3lQjAsmGl": "<h3>FAQ</h3>",
        "text_Fm7Sx4LsmyNq7ecf": "<p>Still have questions?</p>",
        "url_ZQDo5h1tncqNXSoh": "shopify://pages/liosupport",
        "text_51MVT4piI5MLF7a0": "<p>Get in touch</p>",
        "tab_title_NEDiiHOu0ukoJGJ2": "Product & Experience",
        "text_xxgTYQmmQuYtZ0yt": "<h3>What does it taste like?</h3>",
        "text_gjXDppQvzHAYhhdk": "<p>If you're used to vapor, Lio may not be as strong as you'd expect at first. Lio can be compared to a herbal tea if vapor was compared to a sticky soda. Not as sweet, and a lot more natural.</p>",
        "text_n0ldEFlc1uhHzXnq": "<h3>What is Lio?</h3>",
        "text_R8IkbtGrbvrVm07W": "<p>Lio is a natural habit-breaking device that uses aromatherapy to help you manage cravings without nicotine, chemicals, or harmful additives. It works through olfactory conditioning, the science of how scent influences your brain and behavior.</p>",
        "text_ogvCJxGGfTvpyphk": "<h3>How does Lio work?</h3>",
        "text_FMPm5Eit6Ov93X2G": "<p>Stopping a bad habit cold turkey is extremely hard on your brain. Lio helps by replacing your hand-to-mouth fixation, encouraging calming breaths that reduce stress, activating scent receptors that interrupt habit pathways, and providing immediate sensory satisfaction with natural aromatherapy. You're breathing nothing but clean air infused with natural plant aromatics, no nicotine, no chemicals, no vapor.</p>",
        "text_OTfSsTtIoveySVyb": "<h3>How can something with no nicotine actually work?</h3>",
        "text_FYZCZwlIJcziKwbn": "<p>Here's what most people don't know: addiction isn't just about the chemical substance. Science shows it's ritual plus chemical. The hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breathing, the sensory triggers, these behavioral patterns create 50-70% of the addiction. Lio targets this ritual component. Your brain doesn't just crave the substance, it craves the entire experience. That's why customers say it \"works like magic\" even without nicotine.</p>",
        "text_NgFxUQ5ZmocemyNP": "<h3>This looks like another wellness gimmick. Is it really different?</h3>",
        "text_Ef0TgmjZFhqxaCFI": "<p>Lio isn't based on Instagram trends. It's grounded in established research on olfactory conditioning and behavioral psychology. We use pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from IFRA-certified EU farms, have multiple 3rd party toxicology reports, and have helped 100,000+ customers across 50+ countries achieve real results. Our devices are produced in the Netherlands with medical-grade materials. This is a clinical tool based on sensory science, not a lifestyle accessory.</p>",
        "text_g4sR5gDX1VhUIiYG": "<h3>Will this actually satisfy my cravings?</h3>",
        "text_tv8bdwKz4GJ7cP0p": "<p>Yes. Lio mimics the physical sensations you're craving: the throat hit from menthol blends, the hand-to-mouth ritual, the stress relief from deep breathing, and the immediate sensory reward. You're not white-knuckling through cravings, you're satisfying them in a healthier way. As one customer said: \"It gives the throat feeling like a cig without the harm.\"</p>",
        "text_qskGcfv7oOia8hnS": "<h3>Will it work for my specific habit?</h3>",
        "text_CdmXG6ZZFjr144wo": "<p>Lio works for any behavior driven by ritual and sensory triggers: chain smoking, vaping, electric shisha, sugar cravings, nail biting, and any repetitive hand-to-mouth behavior. The common thread isn't the substance, it's the pattern. If your habit involves repetitive motion and immediate gratification, Lio's sensory replacement approach will work.</p>",
        "tab_title_EzgcnF7MLdzarsTf": "SAFETY & INGREDIENTS",
        "text_xNLgV0v7IM73nB1y": "<h3>Is Lio safe?</h3>",
        "text_HcBQ93CKxxk4rdOm": "<p>Yes. Multiple 3rd party toxicology reports and studies have been done on the inhalation and digestion of the plant compounds we use. We're committed to funding ongoing research. BreatheLio is the healthiest, most natural habit-breaking method available.</p>",
        "text_pNa3x3Z5wRO0Hb7s": "<h3>What are Flavour Cores made of?</h3>",
        "text_fX4dG9Lkec9O1Og5": "<p>Each Core is made from medical-grade polyester fiber infused with 100% organic natural essential oils from IFRA-certified EU farms. We use pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from certified manufacturers and natural plant extracts like peppermint, black pepper, cinnamon, and botanical aromas. Everything is blended in our Netherlands laboratory where we combine science and aromatherapy to create sophisticated, natural formulations.</p>",
        "text_uSDHoqJKix0ZDbih": "<h3>Does Lio contain nicotine?</h3>",
        "text_TXOY8bl8CCM9xHdv": "<p>No. Lio is 100% nicotine-free. You're breathing pure air with natural aromatics while satisfying the behavioral patterns that make change so difficult.</p>",
        "text_7h5Ii3mj90Iv7LHa": "<h3>Is Lio vegan and allergen-free?</h3>",
        "text_A278UNVYKPOYhccO": "<p>Yes! Every aroma is 100% natural, vegan, and allergen-free. Safe to use anywhere, anytime, even after you've brushed your teeth.</p>",
        "text_XD4qnzdlUEkcZf0y": "<h3>Where do your ingredients come from?</h3>",
        "text_vlWQuaNYfngS9u8r": "<p>All ingredients come from European IFRA-certified farms. Our pharmaceutical-grade aromatics are produced by certified manufacturers within the EU, extracted from natural ingredients only.</p>",
        "tab_title_LXoOgNeKik7BrtAy": "USAGE & RESULTS",
        "text_ILWHfUA6SjHPWKjJ": "<h3>How do the Flavour Cores work?</h3>",
        "text_46NemNwWQfPfcEgY": "<p>Each Core contains natural essential oils and plant extracts held in a medical-grade fiber matrix. As you inhale, air flows through the Core and picks up therapeutic scent that travels directly to your brain's olfactory region, helping to manage cravings, calm stress, and break unwanted habits.</p>",
        "text_gbHnbNcMOMrJ5QPF": "<h3>How long do Flavour Cores last?</h3>",
        "text_Mo27W9byB16cOmzl": "<p>Each Core pack contains 3 Cores, providing 10+ days of flavor. </p>",
        "text_EPooubRoa5qJjDnM": "<h3>How often can I use Lio?</h3>",
        "text_4QdwpLAjbA8w6hdS": "<p>As often as you like, anywhere, anytime, even after you've brushed your teeth! Please note: if Lio is negatively affecting you, stop and contact your physician.</p>",
        "text_rDvIwVsB1MBVdQ4k": "<h3>What results can I expect?</h3>",
        "text_YKGVJZBwSdKiw97f": "<p>100,000+ customers across 50+ countries are experiencing real results. Many report significant reduction or complete elimination of their habits within the first few weeks. It's not magic, you still have the first 72 hours to go through nicotine withdrawal, but Lio makes it easier by satisfying the ritual while your body adjusts. After the first 3 days, the ritual replacement effect becomes stronger and the process gets significantly easier.</p>",
        "tab_title_U7YNGNh7Ww7JQKEi": "SHIPPING & RETURNS",
        "text_FznwyH4lJtHmPgbN": "<h3>Do you offer free shipping?</h3>",
        "text_ldICCYGCNPCmbTag": "<p>Yes! Free shipping on all orders from €20.</p>",
        "text_jCL1JHnlKjibw6M8": "<h3>How fast is delivery?</h3>",
        "text_WBZBwGyCyRZo83SH": "<p>We provide 1-3 days delivery across our shipping regions.</p>",
        "text_plFLnuarTcqIppy6": "<h3>Where is Lio produced and shipped from?</h3>",
        "text_IGYtCzeGIvsGHYTa": "<p>Lio devices are produced in the Netherlands using the highest quality standards. We don't dropship, everything is manufactured locally and shipped directly from our Netherlands facility by our trusted shipping partners. You'll receive tracking information once your order is dispatched.</p>",
        "text_N98aExawHYBrpC6E": "<h3>What is your return policy?</h3>",
        "text_AH83tpWdS8guFEHI": "<p>We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you're not satisfied with Lio, you can return it within 30 days for a full refund. Try Lio risk-free for 30 days. If it doesn't help you break your habit, we'll refund your purchase. No questions asked.</p>",
        "text_nW2ADXwQopnga0mi": "<h3>How do I claim my money back?</h3>",
        "text_srD4DGNvvaJUKZyD": "<p>To request a refund under our 30-day money-back guarantee, contact our support team at <a href=\"mailto:support@breathelio.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@breathelio.com</a> with your order number and reason for return. We'll provide you with return instructions. Once we receive your returned item, we'll process your full refund within 5-7 business days. No hassle, no complicated forms—just reach out and we'll take care of you.</p>",
        "text_jUv3kJiN6MjH6Kd9": "<h3>What to do if my order didn't arrive?</h3>",
        "text_u7vNscYdvD47SV43": "<p>First, check your tracking information to see the current status of your delivery. If your order is delayed beyond the expected delivery window or shows as delivered but you haven't received it, contact us immediately at <a href=\"mailto:support@breathelio.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@breathelio.com</a> with your order number. Our team will investigate with the shipping carrier and ensure you receive your order or arrange a replacement.</p>",
        "text_naIFGsRKNW6ZVFW0": "<p>Still have questions?</p>",
        "url_RCJ857bMxPSlKVdr": "mailto:support@breathelio.com",
        "text_3ScLgSQ4YGz6HbB6": "<p>Get in touch</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
