        "text_GzBnImmE0KMDU8kZ": "<p>James (38) </p>",
        "text_IwiPEDorpjt99AOH": "<p>\"I've had the habit for the last 30 years. I've been on this now for a week, loving it. I'm not craving at all. No chemicals, it's all just flavored air. It's perfect, really good.\"</p>",
