    "instant_bt_hl_j6j_lwd5yz_k_db_wdXym8": {
      "type": "instant-BtHlJ6jLWD5yzKDb",
      "name": "TRUST SCIENCE",
      "settings": {
        "text_yU72ZwJsyVO0FMlB": "<p><strong>DON&apos;T TRUST US. </strong></p><p><strong>TRUST SCIENCE.</strong></p>",
        "text_3cnUv8AmCRdMOaPx": "<p><em>Swipe to understand how </em></p><p><em>habits actually work →</em></p>",
        "url_IVUVxXMuiH6QkhVP": "",
        "text_OHwMLoToSAbp1OAR": "<p><strong>YOUR HABITS RUN ON AUTOPILOT</strong></p>",
        "text_p7MKIJNa43sldAjI": "<p>40% of what you do daily is automatic, your brain&apos;s just pressing \"play\" on programmed routines.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fun fact:</strong> You&apos;ve repeated your bad habit 10,000+ times. That&apos;s why willpower alone has a 95% failure rate.</p>",
        "url_HXRLnyTJSy303FRu": "",
        "text_YnWMjctHA8FTvu04": "<p><strong>YOU&apos;RE IN THE HABIT LOOP</strong></p>",
        "text_FXoDdeLo278LuZn7": "<p>Every habit follows the same pattern:</p><p></p><p><strong>Trigger</strong> → You feel stress </p><p><strong>Craving</strong> → You want relief <strong>Routine</strong> → You do the habit <strong>Reward</strong> → You feel better</p><p></p><p><strong>Why Lio works:</strong> It keeps the loop intact but swaps the routine for something healthier.</p>",
        "url_RbsNqRJtYNMmeMnt": "",
        "text_ZVqd6knHnTM3oGy1": "<p><strong>THE RITUAL IS THE ADDICTION</strong></p>",
        "text_l5olT2NYLAianEvD": "<p>The physical act, hand-to-mouth movement, the breath, familiar sensation. is deeply ingrained, separate from any substance.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lio targets this:</strong> Same motion. Same breath. Same satisfaction. Just without harmful substances.</p>",
        "url_bk6glz978TGKW9ou": "",
        "text_D4Znr4N6rqACMGFo": "<p><strong>SCENT INFLUENCES BRAIN CHEMISTRY</strong></p>",
        "text_iUDCc2H8mEMzkd2Y": "<p>Olfactory conditioning is the science of how smell affects behavior. Scent connects directly to your brain&apos;s emotional center.</p><p></p><p><strong>The mechanism:</strong> Natural aromatics travel to your olfactory system, helping manage cravings and reduce stress instantly.</p>",
        "url_SIEFIsPMtErOUl9g": "",
        "text_XZ5oeYZhA7YAdxDU": "<p><strong>CHANGE IS A PROCESS</strong></p>",
        "text_YVqMnYhKhBaplv7T": "<p>Behavioral change moves through stages. Most methods fail during the maintenance phase. </p><p></p><p><strong>Awareness → Planning → Action → Maintenance. </strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Lio&apos;s role:</strong> Provides consistent support, making the transition less abrupt and more sustainable.</p>",
        "url_cGINamzI0Ddy91S1": "",
        "text_rJvBMIPJG1SsGD0o": "<p><strong>100,000+ CUSTOMERS</strong></p>",
        "text_yPpxLOwp2FhzwnAF": "<p>Real people. Real results. This approach is grounded in established research on olfactory conditioning and behavioral psychology.</p><p></p><p><strong>The difference:</strong> Working with your brain&apos;s natural patterns instead of fighting against them.</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "instant_u_an_vl_mfa9_e8_iu_pz_k_inRLW8": {
